{"overview":{"Symbol":"NNE","Name":"NANO Nuclear Energy Inc.","Description":"NANO Nuclear Energy Inc. operates as a nuclear energy company. The company is developing KRONOS MMR Energy System, a high-temperature gas-cooled reactor; LOKI MMR, a compact microreactor designed for remote and specialized applications; ZEUS, a solid core battery reactor; and ODIN, a low-pressure salt coolant reactor. It is also developing a high-assay low-enriched uranium fuel processing facility to provide a fuel pipeline for the nuclear reactor industry, and fuel transportation and nuclear consultation businesses. The company was incorporated in 2022 and is based in New York, New York.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NasdaqCM","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Industrials","Industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","Address":"10 Times Square, New York, NY, 10018, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"1158669312","EBITDA":"-44967152","PERatio":"","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"11.441","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"-0.68","RevenuePerShareTTM":"","ProfitMargin":"0","OperatingMarginTTM":"0","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"-0.07697","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"-0.08611","RevenueTTM":"","GrossProfitTTM":"","DilutedEPSTTM":"-0.68","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"","AnalystTargetPrice":"46.66667","TrailingPE":"","ForwardPE":"-22.568527","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"","PriceToBookRatio":"1.9430119","EVToRevenue":"","EVToEBITDA":"-12.992","Beta":"5.044","52WeekHigh":"60.87","52WeekLow":"18.93","50DayMovingAverage":"24.8515","200DayMovingAverage":"31.378775","SharesOutstanding":"52121875","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEquity":"0.437"},"daily":{"Meta Data":{"1. Information":"Daily Time Series (Yahoo Finance, shaped like Alpha Vantage)","2. Symbol":"NNE","3. Last Refreshed":"2026-10-23","4. Output Size":"Compact"},"Time Series (Daily)":{"2026-03-30":{"1. open":"20.040000915527344","2. high":"20.27199935913086","3. low